Officers of University

IQRA UNIVERSITY QUETTA ORDINANCE, 2002
IQRA UNIVERSITY
QUETTA ORDINANCE, 2002
ORDINANCE XVIII OF
2002
(An Ordinance to
provide for the establishment of the Iqra University, Quetta)
[Gazette of
Balochistan, Extraordinary, 2nd November, 2002]
No. Legis: 1-129/Law/2001,
dated 2-11-2002.---The following Ordinance made by the Governor of
Balochistan on 25th October, 2002, is hereby published for general
information:--
CHAPTER-III
OFFICER OF THE
UNIVERSITY
4. Officers of University. ---The
following shall be officers of the University:---
(a) the Patron;
(b) the Chancellor;
(c) the Chariman;
(d) the President;
(e) the Deans;
(f) the Directors;
(g) the Chairmen of the Teaching
Departments;
(h) the Registrar;
(i) the Director of Finance;
(j) the Librarian;
(k) the Controller of Examination;
(l) the Resident Auditor; and
(m) such other persons as may be
prescribed to be the officers of the University.
